+
+    // --- identify_body ---
+
+    /// A nonexistent OVERRIDE path is `RuntimeError::Spawn`, not `NotFound`:
+    /// `Mkvmerge::detect`'s override branch calls `enforce_floor` directly
+    /// (not through `locate()`, which is the only place that remaps a
